On Counter Hit or Wild Punish, it's easily confirmable into your close C for big damage. 
}}
====Close C====
{{FrameDataCargo-COTW
|moveId=terry_cl.C
|description=* Wild Punish +19 (+26 if feint cancelled)
* Goes into his Command Combo on hit and block
* When used on its own, gives massive reward on Counter Hit and Wild Punish
The moneymaker. This is a fast, powerful move that goes into your Command Combo and from there, all of your biggest damage combos. It's also a good button to press on its own, but in many situations, going for the Command Combo is better since it's even more plus on block and gives better returns on hit. 
}}
====Close D====
{{FrameDataCargo-COTW
|name=close D
|moveId=terry_cl.D
|input=cl.D
|description=* Wild Punish +25
* Hits twice, easily confirming whether the opponent is blocking or getting hit
* You can link 2A from this move on normal hit and frame trap into it on block
