This is Terry's multi-purpose heavy, being as fast and almost as far reaching without the caveat of whiffing on crouch. It’s also very combo-friendly, easily working from his cl.C Command Combo. At 0 on hit and -6 on block, however, you always want to cancel it, so beware of any Hyper Defense Guard Cancels your opponent may try. 
