After being notoriously terrible in Garou, Terry's sweep is quite good  in this game, at least in comparison to the rest of the cast, and it complements his gameplan well, stopping opponents from simply walking out of his spacing traps, not to mention doing so may make them lose their ability to punish it. 

Technically, it's fast enough to combo from cl.C command combo for a sudden knockdown that can potentially mess up the opponent expecting a different combo route. Of course, you lose out on a lot of damage in doing so.
