Terry summons swirling winds and does a spinning side kick. If it connects, Terry does a high kick with his other leg, sending his opponent into the eye of a large tornado. Terry then leaps into the air and slams his fist into the ground, igniting and infusing the tornado with energy. Terry then shouts, channeling more energy into the tornado and causes it to explode.
* Has the fastest startup among his supers and reliably combos from almost any juggle, which can be useful if you messed up a corner route.
* Leaves Terry at near fullscreen distance with poor oki. Best course of action is generally a REV Power Wave followed with a run.
